Description: Manuscript-linked analysis records for defense candidates near
    predicted prophages in Desulfovibrio. The default R and Quarto workflow
    verifies saved inputs and results, exports supplementary table contents
    and redraws frozen results. Parameterised scientific-revision source is
    provided separately and is never fitted by the default workflow.
